  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You rock slow and steady.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Genre class feature, Perform 5 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can forgo the normal damage from a rock out or solo in order to slow the flow. All enemies who would normally take damage from your rock out of solo must make a Will save (DC 10 + 1/2 rockstar level + Charisma modifier) or have their movement speeds reduced by 50% (minimum 5 feet) until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-feats#toc46\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
